<tr><td colspan=2>RARR HORDE!!<br>
<br>
ULUL would like to say dat da Raid on CT was a great success, but ULUL would be wrong. How ever we did get a few peices of da decayed to help out those SK that are not done. WE killed the AoF twice, first time with no deaths (way to go Jezelle, Zherron, and Perne from Battle Cry) Guud Job, and second time losing ULUL, Jezelle and Dizeez. ULUL say guud job Perne, Gaki and Zherron on the second kill. WE got the Thulian Claws both times, glad to say Perne earned his for being a great healer, and Zherron won his for barshing so well.<br>
<br>
Ok as far as the bad point goes, HOrde members handle themselves great, but ULUL need to work on the knowledge of raids with the BC a little bit more. ULUL will organize a smaller Raid just for the BC to help work out the bugs. WE started out great then they started running all over the place and we spent alot of time doing CR. ULUL want to thank Jezelle, Achzizra, and Zmaku for showing up, and a Great thanks to Freyia for poping at the last min. to do the rezes for us. ULUL was much proud of you all. ULUL's hopes are of a better raid this weekend for the Dire in MM. Until then Barsh Well Horde!!<br>
<br>
ULUL Doomonger<br>
Master Fudgemaker<br>
